  "id": "korean-wcs-2015-korea-qualifiers",
  "name": "Korean Pokémon World Championships 2015 Korea qualifiers",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The 2015 Korean qualifiers for the Pokémon World Championships held rounds on 4-5 April 2015 in Daegu and 18-19 April 2015 at Lotte Department Store Yeongdeungpo, then round 3 and the final at the Spring Carnival at Lotte Jamsil from 24 April 2015. Card game entrants in rounds 1-2 received Absol-EX 052/XY-P, those in round 3 and the final received M Absol-EX 053/XY-P, and top players received Victory Ring cards 054 to 056/XY-P; Ditto 050/XY-P and Regirock 051/XY-P were bonuses for buying expansion packs at the qualifiers."
  },
